l blank shapes without facial features, mountain landscape visible behind the matrix, symmetrical grid composition.\n\nAct 8 (10.5-13s): All 18 olive nuts remain in fixed grid positions, each nut rotates 360 degrees simultaneously, then arhat faces sequentially reveal one by one from first to last (left to right, top to bottom), each carved arhat face unique and distinct, ink details emerging on nut surfaces, all 18 faces fully revealed by end of act.\n\nAct 9 (13-15s): Camera slowly pushes forward and zooms in on one specific arhat olive nut in the matrix, gradually magnifying to close-up, single arhat face filling frame with detailed ink carving texture, mountain landscape blurred in background, ending on dramatic close-up of the arhat face.\n\nThroughout: pure black and white ink wash with subtle golden foil accents on mountain peaks, five ink shades (焦浓重淡清), rice paper texture maintained consistently, ultra-smooth ink diffusion and bleeding transitions between all acts, no sudden cuts, seamless morphing between scenes, consistent ink brush stroke style, oriental zen aesthetic, cinematic lighting and depth, 8K ultra HD, masterpiece quality"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [959.3888549804688, 1499.1549072265625], "id": 24, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "video", "links": [30], "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["", "720p", "15", true, "16:9", false, 895575965, "randomize", true, "all", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": 